Think this sucks?

27:03.663 --> 27:05.749
If you do, you can just join the Union.

27:06.791 --> 27:10.128
You all live like this because
you still go to Eunjang, you idiots.

27:10.211 --> 27:11.713
Get a grip, will you?

27:11.796 --> 27:13.798
I would've already transferred
if I were you.

27:13.882 --> 27:15.759
Hey, smile a little.

27:19.638 --> 27:20.639
What?

27:20.722 --> 27:22.015
Is Seong-je inside?

27:23.642 --> 27:24.684
What?

27:25.268 --> 27:27.270
I'm Choi Hyo-man of Eunjang High.

27:27.354 --> 27:30.023
I was supposed to meet Seong-je today.
Is he in there?

27:31.107 --> 27:32.442
- Right.
- He's in.

27:33.151 --> 27:36.112
- Yeah, Seong-je hyeong's in there.
- Ah, thank you.

27:36.946 --> 27:37.781
Hey.

27:40.325 --> 27:41.701
Give 'em what they want.

27:45.955 --> 27:48.792
What was that?
Eunjang's really joining the Union?

27:48.875 --> 27:52.295
But isn't Baku Eunjang's top dog?
What the hell is he doing here?

28:00.095 --> 28:02.430
Okay, I'll bring more supplies next month.

28:03.181 --> 28:04.391
Sure. Get lost.

28:12.774 --> 28:13.942
DAEHYEON HIGH, GANGHAK HIGH

28:14.025 --> 28:15.694
Whoa, man. That's a lot.

28:18.780 --> 28:21.282
Seong-je? It's me, Hyo-man.

28:22.742 --> 28:25.120
- Playing a game?
- You fucking idiots.

28:26.079 --> 28:27.914
I told you just to aggravate them.

28:28.790 --> 28:30.625
Right. Sorry, my bad.

28:30.709 --> 28:34.295
This is why I never
go on raids with low levels.

28:37.424 --> 28:38.550
Speak.

28:39.342 --> 28:41.970
Well, uh, it's about the phones.

28:42.053 --> 28:44.973
I need until next week to gather
some more, if that's okay.

28:45.056 --> 28:48.727
But after this, I think I'll be able to
bring in a lot more profit continuously.

28:48.810 --> 28:50.353
I'm pretty sure about that.

28:50.437 --> 28:54.023
Also, about what we discussed
about you putting an end to everything

28:54.107 --> 28:56.860
after Park Hu-min returns
from his suspension…

28:56.943 --> 28:57.986
Next week?

28:58.069 --> 29:01.489
Yes, I'll absolutely make sure
that I bring a hundred phones by then.

29:02.031 --> 29:05.118
Wow. Man, I… I never make these mistakes.

29:06.161 --> 29:08.121
Make sure you have the stuff next week.

29:08.204 --> 29:10.707
Of course, man.
My loyalty's with you.

29:10.790 --> 29:13.668
These high-school punks
are pretty scary, eh?

29:13.752 --> 29:15.378
Kids pretendin' to be gangsters.

29:16.588 --> 29:18.923
The little shits deserve a good beating.

29:21.009 --> 29:23.136
Is this kid
a Gen Z gangster or what?

29:23.636 --> 29:25.180
Fucking Gen Z punks.

29:28.516 --> 29:31.019
Oh great. What do you want?

29:53.208 --> 29:54.209
Hey.

29:54.876 --> 29:56.878
Seong-je? You must be busy.

29:57.962 --> 29:59.297
Sorry, I'll head out.

30:02.801 --> 30:04.469
What was that prick's name again?

30:11.935 --> 30:16.564
PRESIDENT CHOI

30:16.648 --> 30:18.274
MISSED CALL: PRESIDENT CHOI

30:18.358 --> 30:20.860
VICE PRESIDENT:
LOST YOUR MIND? YOU'RE DEAD

30:20.944 --> 30:22.153
CHOI: SEE YOU TOMORROW LOL

30:56.771 --> 30:58.439
Newton's third law.

30:59.816 --> 31:01.276
For every action,

31:02.277 --> 31:03.820
there's a reaction

31:04.571 --> 31:08.324
in the same force,
but in the opposite direction.

31:56.581 --> 31:57.498
Im Han-ul.

31:57.582 --> 31:59.459
CLASS 1, IM HAN-UL
I'M SORRY, LOOK INSIDE

32:01.461 --> 32:03.046
Kwon Ju…

32:05.006 --> 32:05.882
Kwon Ju-ho.

32:07.884 --> 32:09.969
Song Gi-wan, Song Gi-wan.

32:10.053 --> 32:11.262
Song Gi-wan.

32:14.599 --> 32:17.185
Baek Seung-u. Do Jae-gyeong.

32:20.146 --> 32:21.397
Mo Il-yeong.

32:21.481 --> 32:22.523
Hong Seong-gwan.

32:23.066 --> 32:24.067
Seo Jong-ho.

32:24.150 --> 32:26.694
Kwak Byeong-min. Kim Hun-yeong.

32:27.612 --> 32:28.655
Kim Jun-su.

32:32.158 --> 32:35.536
11TH GRADE, CLASS 4
12 - YEON SI-EUN

32:53.596 --> 32:55.264
Stop messing around, bro.

32:55.848 --> 32:58.059
Let me see.
You say you got it back. Show me.

32:58.601 --> 33:01.020
Hey look. Is this your phone?

33:01.104 --> 33:02.188
It's my phone, you idiot.

33:02.271 --> 33:05.024
- You're right.
- God, Jun-tae's lost his mind.

33:05.108 --> 33:07.485
Why's that traitor
suddenly acting like a patriot?

33:07.986 --> 33:11.614
Look. The important thing is
he returned them to everyone, not just me.

33:11.698 --> 33:12.740
I bet he's transferring.

33:12.824 --> 33:14.575
Is Choi Hyo-man at school yet?

33:14.659 --> 33:16.995
Hyo-man gets vicious
when he loses his shit.

33:17.078 --> 33:18.746
Jun-tae is dead for real.

33:29.382 --> 33:32.927
CLASS 4, YEON SI-EUN
I'M SORRY, LOOK INSIDE, THANK YOU

33:55.408 --> 33:57.076
Who did you say it was?

34:04.125 --> 34:06.836
Answer me, you goddamn assholes. Who?

34:08.963 --> 34:11.007
It's Seo Jun-tae.

34:11.883 --> 34:13.593
He did class rounds this morning.

34:27.440 --> 34:29.233
Move aside, you assholes!

34:36.783 --> 34:38.159
- Shit.
- Oh.

34:38.785 --> 34:40.203
Seo Jun-tae!

34:46.626 --> 34:48.377
Where's that fucking asshole?

34:49.629 --> 34:50.546
Uh, over there.

34:52.965 --> 34:55.927
"For every positive action,
there's a positive reaction that follows."

34:57.303 --> 35:00.223
"For every positive action,
there's a positive reaction that follows."

35:00.306 --> 35:02.475
Jun-tae-ya.

35:02.558 --> 35:05.269
"For every positive action,
there's a positive reaction that follows."

35:05.937 --> 35:07.271
Come on out.

35:17.240 --> 35:19.659
I'll come to you, then.

35:22.787 --> 35:24.330
Fuckin' asshole!

35:24.413 --> 35:26.332
- Gosh! No way!
- Oh!

35:26.415 --> 35:28.793
- Oh man, he's really hurting.
- Hey.

35:29.919 --> 35:31.462
- You did that?
- He's so bad!

35:31.546 --> 35:33.714
Did you really give them all back,
asshole?

35:33.798 --> 35:35.216
It's about to go down.

35:35.299 --> 35:37.802
- He's gotta do something.
- It's about to go down!

35:39.720 --> 35:40.972
How badass.

35:46.686 --> 35:48.688
- Fight, come on! Fight!
- You can do it, Jun-tae!

35:48.771 --> 35:50.439
Shit, your guard is freaking sturdy.

35:50.523 --> 35:52.775
- Huh? Hey, that's cool. Huh?
- Let's go, let's go!

35:52.859 --> 35:55.862
- Give it to me. Bro, fucking let go.
- He's fucking sturdy!

35:55.945 --> 35:58.531
- Oh!
- You're a good dancer, puppy Jun-tae!

36:01.742 --> 36:03.327
Try to block this, huh?

36:03.411 --> 36:05.705
Nice shot!

36:05.788 --> 36:07.415
Come on!

36:08.833 --> 36:11.627
A honey hotteok mouth guard!

36:13.796 --> 36:15.548
So gross, man.

36:16.299 --> 36:17.758
Oh my gosh.

36:20.052 --> 36:23.014
A little bitch like you should
only do what I say.

36:23.097 --> 36:24.182
That's right.

36:24.265 --> 36:26.767
I'm the reason you had
an easy time at school.

36:26.851 --> 36:29.353
Should I make you kill yourself,
you piece of shit?

36:30.605 --> 36:33.232
You son of a bitch.
Huh? You son of a bitch.

36:33.316 --> 36:35.067
Hey! Hey!

36:35.151 --> 36:37.778
You fucking asshole. You little fucker.

36:40.031 --> 36:43.284
No matter
what kind of fucking shit you do,

36:43.367 --> 36:44.911
nothing will change, you bitch.

36:44.994 --> 36:46.287
Got it?

36:47.330 --> 36:48.789
Bitch.

37:30.248 --> 37:33.167
- Hey, shouldn't someone stop him?
- Hey, Chief Seo, little buddy.

37:33.251 --> 37:35.253
- Don't get into this.
- We're almost done.

37:35.962 --> 37:37.838
Whoa…

37:44.345 --> 37:45.763
You're being too loud.

37:49.308 --> 37:50.351
Huh?

37:55.523 --> 37:57.066
Let's not cross the line.

37:57.566 --> 37:59.568
Ooh!

38:00.569 --> 38:02.280
What? Whoa!
